I made a type in the code. The following should be working:

hypothesis(fit, "sd_UPPERGEOG__Intercept^2 / (sd_UPPERGEOG__Intercept^2 + sd_obs__Intercept^2) = 0", class = "")

If it throws an error about non-existent parameter names, please run parnames(fit) to see the parameter names of your model.

See also help(hypothesis) for more help.

Best
Paul

